Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.00,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs60}{\fad(150,200)\an8}本字幕由爪爪字幕组制作，仅供交流试看之用，请于24小时内删除\N交流群QQ：571435381，招募群QQ：641455611（翻译，校对等职位招募中）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:42.00,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}来源：官方字幕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:45.00,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}润色：爪爪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:48.00,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}压制：相簿、白、囧冏浻烱、120903
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\shad0\bord0\c&H6356AC&\pos(960,637.2)}爪爪字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,货车会从东边进入夜之城
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在市郊夺取整车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,报酬是250万
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,大家按照平常的份额瓜分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是我成为赛博朋克以来 接到最大的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,反正目标是公司狗 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概能猜到 我们要在哪位太岁头上动土了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是荒坂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在担心50万干一票 值得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,再说了 我们人手够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,护卫队的安保规模特别小
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看来荒坂刻意压低人数 避免引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那里就是我们此次进攻的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不要想得太复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,取走目标货物 交给客户
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,和平常一样的差事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,和平常一样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为他扛得住义体金刚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,从大卫适应斯安威斯坦的那一刻起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就吸引了荒坂公司的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,田中把他召回学院 为的就是实验义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而这女孩企图损坏数据 避免他们找上门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还打算掩盖一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来是的 田中的脑子也是露西烧掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩和多莉欧只是附带的牺牲品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,从结果上看 确实如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,长相可爱 但真是个可怕的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为了救心上人 她还会杀多少人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在更深层的潜入中发现 她曾经是荒坂的资产
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是被遣送到旧网的黑客战士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才知道如何通过荒坂的ICE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是天降惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,与荒坂的谈判多了张好牌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,靠着她飞升公司的顶端 不再是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是你的目标吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,中间人不就是喂饱赛博朋克的圣光饲养员吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,想在夜之城出人头地的方法只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上公司的顶端
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来 我还会需要你的协助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,都这样了 你还要我继续背叛他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这对你来说 也是千载难逢的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,田中的案子我拿到了公司豁免 可是你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是一样笑里藏刀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看在往日情谊的份上 我们好好合作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂要什么给什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,同时还可以给军用科技放消息
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂一定不会拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你谈妥公司豁免权和酬劳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,在夜之城不要相信任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,被利用了也是自己的错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫也是谈判的筹码吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:05:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 我有个好计策
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我会向荒坂提出献上他们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 有个大案子想委托你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,紧急会议是什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第的委托
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是目前最大的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,高风险高回报
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没准备好的话 现在反悔还来得及
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇 我也需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老头老太太都可以轻松搞定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我还怕你孤单呢 小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,任务内容是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,安保队伍很小 但枪火很重
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一半会跟法拉第安插好的分流小组走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,分流小组
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上就是诱饵 当然他们自己应该不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第的典型做派
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我们是否是诱饵也无从得知
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们分成三组
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,主要目标偏离道路 机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,换挡 法尔科
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这就来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.51,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样踩油门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 车已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这些全是免疫抑制剂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我拿上我妈的外套好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这工作我们不做了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个请求
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.95,0:07:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 除了你以外 我没有人可托付了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样对我太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不许你用斯安威斯坦 听见没
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉一个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 我们已经紧紧咬住目标了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我来黑入刹车系统
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 后方有敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,片刻不得安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不准用斯安威斯坦…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,护航车夺取成功
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你用了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们直接撞上目标
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 把电击弹送到集装箱上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,讲真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这队长…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:08:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大家还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,臭胡子 你看不见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那个武装怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ICE也很厚 黑不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那我从前面打爆它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是够了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真是受够了 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有司机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西是自动驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,偷袭正如期进行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的举动和我们计划的一致
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,干得非常好 法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都很顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,消息也透露给军用科技了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会拿到义体金刚的实战数据了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 前提是大卫能驾驭义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他失败的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的抢救小队 就会跟军用科技正面对上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是大卫和军用科技先动上手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的棋子会听我命令行事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你保持安全距离 观赏即可
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,得在它掉下去之前拦住它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.31,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退 我们从现在起不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…你将如何决定呢 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.14,0:10:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,到悬崖边缘了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔科 开近一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,朝我的方向发射鱼叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等我口号 踩刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,丢就丢 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 振作一点 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,事情变得复杂 你就又想逃避了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,自己来做选择
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是独特的 还记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,踩下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.85,0:11:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们办到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妙极了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然派高级浮空车来接一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个身价不菲的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}露西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还是没有露西的消息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在多一个网络黑客能帮上什么忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还得多一个分钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那边进展得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可能要花点时间才撬得开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我觉得货车无人驾驶怪怪的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定是荒坂的运输车吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那么担心的话 拿到货物就走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就快打开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,少啰嗦 我们去开车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才在追货车的时候还没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这里这么开阔 如果有人偷袭 我们就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从刚才开始 你就那么紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你的胡子是你浑身上下 唯一有胆量的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕剃掉胡子 你会爱上我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别躲啊 大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看来诱饵失败 他们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,魔蜥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还有导弹车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,军用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么 为什么军用科技偷袭我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第是军用科技的人 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,太蹊跷了 这工作越来越奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.99,0:14:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在外面会被射死 总之先进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是法拉第要曼恩找的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.11,0:14:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,军事级别的植入体
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,军事级别…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说像大卫的斯安威斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,据我所知
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,完全和斯安威斯坦不同口径
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这小子的斯安威斯坦已经够吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次听说这样的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这情报的真实度未知
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不过荒坂认为
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只要将这个投向市场 他们就能压倒军用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一直在秘密研发这套义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分数据都压在田中手里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不晓得法拉第是从哪里得知
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但他竟然答应泄露情报给军用科技 看来交易不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是每天都有荣幸横越夜之城上空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们习惯泡冰池 这里景色很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,助我一臂之力如何 让你的意中人飞起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1009.2,500.8)}{\shad0\bord1\fs40\c&H2425A5&\pos(318,152)\3c&HFFFFFF&}露西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}露西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,露西的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 现在这个节骨眼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 你去哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了 军用科技已经到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些 你人在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也找上我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再这样下去 所有人都会死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想活命的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:15:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就装上义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 我相信你办得到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,想活命的话 就装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但露西感觉不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在追杀她 无论如何 我都必须安装
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这台货车是移动义体安装单元
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,平台把安装器设定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你真的要安装
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 要先把大家救出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 我告诉你别装
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不安装 我们全都会死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在真的很想把你揍扁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我去开车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,上回我安装了不是自己的义体 可是被曼恩胖揍一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs100\frz358.3\org(-39,520)\frx28\fry10\pos(307.933,258.4)}{\fax0.4}进行安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs100\frz358.3\org(-39,520)\frx28\fry10\pos(282.599,294.4)}{\fax0.4}进行安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\pos(291.932,290.4)}{\fs100\frz358.3\org(-39,520)\frx28\fry10\pos(282.599,294.4)}{\fax0.4}进行安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs100\frz358.3\frx28\fry10\pos(719.932,330.4)\org(326,544)}{\fax0.4}进行安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs65\frz358.3\frx28\fry10\pos(1755.932,282.4)\org(684.666,640)}{\fax0.4}进行安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs35\frz358.3\frx28\fry10\pos(1999.932,286.4)\org(923.333,672)}{\fax0.4}进行安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事还是不会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然真的装了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,960)}{\pos(429.333,410)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}安装进度
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,960)}{\pos(1067.666,410)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,军用科技为何停火
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我完成我的工作 要撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,非常优秀 军用科技会让你过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在老地方会合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 不要安装义体金刚 那是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 怎么了 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是法拉第 全部都是他策划的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第跟荒坂是一伙儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,目的就是要你安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他要用你对抗军用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,然后荒坂抢救小组会过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不要安装义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我们不懂装保险装置吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fax0.1\fs35\bord0\c&H7AEFF8&\frx358\fry10\frz353.1\move(978.666,576.666,1835.999,407.332,7,1967)}通往小中国南部
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,军用科技只想得到义体金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,丢下它 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,要在后脑再开个深潜接口吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在恐怕无法听电话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,任务进行得还顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 你把露西怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,给我背后捅刀子的女人 正被我踩在脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会好好整治她的脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这还远远不够
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的臭脚移开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这笔高额交易 荒坂要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在就去交货
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等会儿就由荒坂来照顾她了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\pos(276,328.666)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}安装进度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\pos(1104.999,328.666)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你正在快速失去人格意识
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去 还没等装完就会变成赛博疯子的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在被军用科技的精英部队包围
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快安装义体金刚 看看自己能不能逃得掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.57,0:19:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我个人赌你扛不住 但荒坂非常看好你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真有自己说的那份独特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就用行动证明给我看 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\move(1219.667,296,1190.334,316,0,967)}{\shad0\bord0\fs50\t(0,970,\fs55)\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把他杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(546.333,634)}{\shad0\bord0\fs90\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(993,434)}{\shad0\bord0\fs70\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1147.667,344.667)}{\shad0\bord0\fs60\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1213,306)}{\shad0\bord0\fs55\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1235.667,291.333)}{\shad0\bord0\fs50\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\pos(1151.666,343.332)}{\shad0\bord0\fs48\c&H2425A5&}义体融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去救露西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:20:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你果然疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第在背后捅我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他绑走了露西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那个王八蛋 我永远不会放过他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓把他碎尸万段
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔科 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇背叛了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.01,0:20:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她把我们引到陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.43,0:20:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那个臭老太婆也和他们一伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让她得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,军用科技的人都疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没看过这副景象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么有办法戴着这个走路
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,内部有两个浮空车压缩推进器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还有荒坂设计的重力变更原型机
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能产生重力磁场 改变磁极
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那是磁力产生器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一瞬间就把他们都打爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他同时也在用斯安威斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是重力场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.31,0:21:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个科技还在实验中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,其控制太过复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.23,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,义体承载人的神经系统是否能够承受 完全无法保证
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,需要超乎常人的坚毅心智 才能对抗这样的植入体
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎是通向赛博精神病的单程票
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他被干掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,身体是没事 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,每使用一次 就距离过载更进一步
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但他短暂获得的超强战力…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.99,0:22:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.2\fs60\frz336\pos(676,347.333)}{\bord0\c&H6BFF5F&}威胁已完全排除
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.99,0:22:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,远远
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,超出我们的想像…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.55,0:23:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第背叛我们 我们要找他算账
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要救出露西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.17,0:23:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么说 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,同甘共苦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的原则
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 小子 我们跟你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,直奔地狱吧
Comment: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.03,0:00:21.42,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes burning a way through me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.61,0:00:27.77,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes destroying so sweetly
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.32,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Now there is a fire in me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.73,0:00:42.50,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}A fire that burns
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.56,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}This fire is out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.36,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.36,0:01:13.21,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.03,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.42,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.69,0:01:25.49,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.34,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.16,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.55,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Comment: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:31.16,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:21.42,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:27.77,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼着甜蜜杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.32,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}现在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:42.50,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我残躯化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.56,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}这簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.36,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:13.21,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.03,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.42,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:25.49,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.34,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.16,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.55,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
Comment: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:38.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.77,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.77,0:23:59.20,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:03.54,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:07.90,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:12.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:16.12,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.49,0:24:21.03,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:24.85,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.05,0:24:28.65,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:33.90,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.90,0:24:37.10,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:40.94,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.76,0:24:48.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:52.63,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:59.92,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:25:00.48,0:25:02.48,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.77,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他们终究会擦出爱情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.77,0:23:59.20,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化为血液 在我体内流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:03.54,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我会引燃这座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:07.90,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我们从未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:12.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去获得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:16.12,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只为让你见我所见
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.49,0:24:21.03,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:24.85,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你无法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.05,0:24:28.65,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}请原谅我 让你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:33.90,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}请原谅我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.90,0:24:37.10,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想还未拥有守护你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:40.94,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只为此时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.76,0:24:48.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的挚爱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:52.63,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我们永恒的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:59.92,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分离
Comment: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
